WEBVTT

00:00:29.358 --> 00:00:31.573
We look like shiny new pennies.

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:34.094
And we get to the receptionist, and we say,

00:00:34.094 --> 00:00:35.474
"We're here for the lunch."

00:00:35.474 --> 00:00:37.678
She motions for us to follow her.

00:00:37.678 --> 00:00:40.120
We walk through a series of corridors,

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.374
and all of a sudden we find ourselves

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:43.040
in a stark room,

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:46.130
at which point she looks at us and she says,

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:50.415
"Where are your uniforms?"

00:00:50.415 --> 00:00:51.661
Just as this happens,

00:00:51.661 --> 00:00:53.990
my friend rushes in.

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:56.438
The blood drains from her face.

00:00:56.438 --> 00:00:58.820
There are literally no words, right?

00:00:58.820 --> 00:00:59.839
And I look at her, and I say,

00:00:59.839 --> 00:01:01.729
"Now, don't you think we need